实用方法","timestamp":195000,"detail":"","points":[{"desc":"・中医识人三步法","detail":"1. 看神：感知对方整体气场（清爽/厚重/温暖/阴冷），相信身体的第一判断\n2. 看气：观察呼吸深浅（丹田/胸口）、说话是否断音、声调变化，气沉者靠谱气浮者不稳\n3. 看色：观察面色明润含蓄与否、眼神清澈度，妆容无法掩盖真实气血色泽\n4. 后续验证：聊天是为了验证第一眼的判断，而非看表演","type":1}]},{"desc":"结语","timestamp":232000,"detail":"","points":[]}],"chapter_recommend_type":1,"chapter_abstract":"中医视角下，看人第一眼要看神和气，因为它们反映了一个人的气血状况和内在能量。阳气足的人自信、挺拔，阳气不足的人则显得萎靡。此外，人的面相还与五行系统有关，反映了五脏能量的不平衡。在交往中，要相信自己的身体感知，观察对方的真实状态，而非表面的表演。","chapter_recommend_source":2,"push_scene":[],"chapter_bar_color":null},"trends_infos":null,"chapter_bar_color":null,"share_post_info":{"share_type":"video","is_open_platform":1,"open_platform_key":"aw7c4z4ej0o3efzd"},"flash_mob_trends":0,"ent_log_extra":{"log_extra":"{\"global_log_extra\":null,\"page_log_extra\":null,\"aweme_log_extra\":{\"ce_current_group_id\":\"7644967070094796529\",\"author_id\":\"952606616199739\"},\"extra_log_extra\":null}"},"personal_page_botton_diagnose_style":0,"aweme_type_tags":""},{"aweme_id":"7644909037109356442","desc":"日有所思夜有所梦是怎么回事","create_time":1779969092,"author":{"uid":"952606616199739","card_sort_priority":null,"nickname":"神龙院长(下期开课6月15日)","card_entries_not_display":null,"white_cover_url":null,"avatar_thumb":{"uri":"100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_2d50790c927c9b8c3c38f8707ed4e8b0","url_list":["https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_2d50790c927c9b8c3c38f8707ed4e8b0.jpeg?from=327834062"],"width":720,"height":720},"private_relation_list":null,"follower_list_secondary_information_struct":null,"follow_status":0,"not_seen_item_id_list_v2":null,"hide_self_recommend_interest":0,"special_people_labels":null,"custom_verify":"","card_entries":null,"cf_list":null,"link_item_list":null,"profile_component_disabled":null,"text_extra":null,"share_info":{"share_url":"","share_weibo_desc":"","share_desc":"","share_title":"","share_qrcode_url":{"uri":"","url_list":[],"width":720,"height":720},"share_title_myself":"","share_title_other":"","share_desc_info